{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54044","headline":"王子颂五首 化生 · 良价","name":"王子颂五首 化生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"傍分帝化（《五灯会元》作「位」，《禅门诸祖师偈颂》作「命」）爲传持，万里山河布政威。\n红影日轮凝下界，碧袖（《禅门诸祖师偈颂》作「油」）风冷暑炎时。\n高低岂废尊卑奉，五袴苏途远近知。\n妙印手持烟塞静，当阳那肯露纤机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"良价","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54044.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54044","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}